cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use stimgrid in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "stimgrid"
abstract: >-
  Fits planned electrical stimulation pulses to a stimulator's real amplitude and
  timing resolution, reports what is actually delivered, and finds the nearest
  exactly charge-balanced pulse on the device grid.
